        <senderName>NWS Tallahassee FL</senderName>
        <headline>Special Weather Statement issued August 2 at 4:55PM EDT by NWS Tallahassee FL</headline>
        <description>At 455 PM EDT, Doppler radar was tracking a strong thunderstorm over
I-75 At Exit 16, or near Valdosta, moving east at 10 mph.

HAZARD...Wind gusts up to 40 mph.

SOURCE...Radar indicated.

IMPACT...Gusty winds could knock down tree limbs and blow around
unsecured objects.

Locations impacted include...
Lake Park, Valdosta, I-75 At Exit 16, Remerton, Dasher, I-75 At Exit
5, Twin Lakes, Clyattville, I-75 At Exit 11, Valdosta Regional
Airport, and Kinderlou.
</description>
        <instruction>If outdoors, consider seeking shelter inside a building.</instruction>
        <web>http://www.weather.gov</web>
