            <value>WWUS84 KOUN 031512</value>
        </parameter>
        <parameter>
            <valueName>NWSheadline</valueName>
            <value>Strong wind gusts associated with dissipating rain showers will impact portions of southwestern Lincoln, southeastern Oklahoma, northeastern Cleveland and northwestern Pottawatomie Counties through 1115 AM CDT</value>
        </parameter>
        <parameter>
