        <onset>2025-08-05T16:39:00-06:00</onset>
        <expires>2025-08-05T17:15:00-06:00</expires>
        <senderName>NWS Rapid City SD</senderName>
        <headline>Special Weather Statement issued August 5 at 4:39PM MDT by NWS Rapid City SD</headline>
        <description>At 439 PM MDT, Doppler radar was tracking a strong thunderstorm 11
miles west of Upton, or 33 miles southwest of Sundance, moving east
at 25 mph.

HAZARD...Wind gusts of 50 to 55 mph and nickel size hail.

SOURCE...Radar indicated.

IMPACT...Gusty winds could knock down tree limbs and blow around
unsecured objects. Minor hail damage to vegetation is
possible.

Locations impacted include...
Upton.
</description>
        <instruction>If outdoors, consider seeking shelter inside a building.</instruction>
