        <headline>Special Weather Statement issued August 5 at 6:44PM EDT by NWS Jacksonville FL</headline>
        <description>At 644 PM EDT, Doppler radar was tracking a strong thunderstorm
just west of Green Cove Springs, moving east at 15 mph.

HAZARD...Wind gusts around 40 mph.

SOURCE...Radar indicated.

IMPACT...Gusty winds could knock down tree limbs and blow around
unsecured objects.

Locations impacted include...
Green Cove Springs, Picolata, and Penney Farms.
</description>
        <instruction>If outdoors, consider seeking shelter inside a building.</instruction>
