        <senderName>NWS Melbourne FL</senderName>
        <headline>Special Weather Statement issued August 5 at 8:16PM EDT by NWS Melbourne FL</headline>
        <description>At 816 PM EDT, Doppler radar was tracking a strong thunderstorm near
Lake Kissimmee, moving northeast at 15 mph.

HAZARD...Wind gusts up to 50 mph and pea size hail.

SOURCE...Radar indicated.

IMPACT...Gusty winds could knock down tree limbs and blow around
unsecured objects. Minor hail damage to vegetation is
possible.

Locations impacted include...
Lake Kissimmee.
</description>
