        <headline>Special Weather Statement issued August 5 at 8:44PM EDT by NWS Jacksonville FL</headline>
        <description>At 843 PM EDT, Doppler radar was tracking a strong thunderstorm over
Silver Springs Shores, or about 4 miles south of Lynne, moving
southeast at 15 mph.

HAZARD...Wind gusts around 40 mph.

SOURCE...Radar indicated.

IMPACT...Gusty winds could knock down tree limbs and blow around
unsecured objects.

Locations impacted include...
Ocklawaha, Moss Bluff, Silver Springs Shores, Lake Weir, and
Belleview.
</description>
        <instruction>If outdoors, consider seeking shelter inside a building.</instruction>
